   "sha256": "3ad34e91a474ea239674b593a5ff1544727a22f7afd3c8a8729260128a5febd1",
   "version": "omp/18.3.5"
  },
  "route": "The documented macOS route's provider fragment and fail-closed config verbatim (examples/manual-tunnel/models.fragment.yml, fail-closed.yml) with PI_OPENAI_STATEFUL=1, in an isolated HOME; OMP in RPC mode, thinking low. A recording reverse proxy on the route's port 127.0.0.1:18089 forwarded to an SSH forward of the production RTX 5090 lane and recorded each request's structure and SSE event types, ids and times; no prompt or output text.",
  "lane": {
   "component": "v0.6.12-qwen38-5090-beta.1",
   "runtime_image": "ghcr.io/alphastorm/ninfer-runtime@sha256:cd9e10b115bbf38df011b201dfdd37ec3b56613da39b2f1701334c8157236b78",
   "deployment_profile": "qwen38-5090-v0.8.2",
   "configuration_sha256": "56878aed92e8f3fb4101884fa889c98d1da75914573ebd167305ca0b4aa83e98"
  },
  "drive": "RPC prompt: count from 1 to 400, one number per line. After 40 message_update events, while the answer's text was streaming, RPC {\"type\":\"steer\"}: stop counting and reply with exactly STEERED-4471. Wait for agent_end.",
  "source_reading": "In 18.3.5, RPC steer calls AgentSession.steer, which queues a user message for the agent loop; mid-stream steering is implemented only for the Codex WebSocket transport, gated on compat.supportsSteering, which custom providers do not set."
 },
